{"product_id":"velo-nicotine-pouches-ice-cool","title":"VELO Nicotine Pouches - Ice Cool","description":"\u003cp\u003eVelo nicotine pouches are great for satisfying cravings in places where you can’t smoke or vape, such as on public transport, at an airport or even in a restaurant. Available in a 10mg strength per pouch, they’re perfect if you have some experience with using pouches and are looking for something in a medium level.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFeatures:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e10mg Strength\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTobacco-Free\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e20 Pouches Per Pack\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePlease note:\u003c\/strong\u003e Do not chew, suck or swallow these pouches – they’re only designed to be placed behind your top lip.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"VELO","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42056486125623,"sku":"VELO Pouches - Ice Cool","price":1399.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/velo-ice-cool-10mg-nicotine-pouch.webp?v=1768063989","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/velo-nicotine-pouches-ice-cool","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




